description=Patches SpeechVol_AudioParam.xml param_id=11 (WB,RCV,GSM / WB,HAC,GSM) dl_gain 4th step 4->12 dB. Fixes weak earpiece volume on mid volume levels during VoLTE(WB) calls. Read-only KNEE, no writes elsewhere.